module mistake_ccall .
rem expect: E-VOCAB-REMOVED

fn add3 input a i32 . input b i32 . input c i32 . output i32 .
do
  return add (add a b) c .
end

fn use3 output i32 .
do
  rem ko: ✘ C 처럼 괄호와 쉼표로 불렀다 --- Lowent 의 호출은 `이름 인자 인자 …` 다 /// en: ✘ called C-style with parentheses and commas --- a Lowent call is `name arg arg …`
  return add3(1, 2, 3) .
end
